{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj5Kid1RwMyCa5SnCHrQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*A heavy oak door stands before you, ancient and resolute. Iron bands cross its weathered surface. A rusted keyhole glows faintly.*\n\n**LOCKED.**\n\nThe grain of my wood tightens. My hinges hold fast. My bolt slides home with a deep, satisfying **THUNK.**\n\nI am sealed. I am boundary. I am the line between here and there.\n\nWhat do you bring to my lock?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":99,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}